<!--
    Launcher foreground — the NexaFlow glyph: a flow line that branches into
    three nodes. It says what the app does — a trigger flowing into actions —
    without a letter or a robot pictogram.

    Language-neutral, so it works in LTR and RTL launchers. Solid fill only,
    100% launcher-safe, and kept inside the 66dp adaptive-icon safe zone.
-->
